# Contact form delivery.
#
# Without these the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client, which
# is what it did before — nothing breaks, but a visitor with no mail client
# configured cannot send an enquiry. Set them in the Vercel project settings.
#
# RESEND_API_KEY  an API key from resend.com
# CONTACT_FROM    a verified sender on a domain you own, e.g.
#                 "Kestro <noreply@kestro.dk>"
# CONTACT_TO      where enquiries land. Defaults to company.email.
RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACT_FROM=
CONTACT_TO=
